{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f0322d7a-6e5d-442f-bfcb-6e6421091d93",
    "name": "Lucky 77 Game API",
    "description": "Lucky 77 REST collection (fixed multipliers: Apple/Watermelon 2x, 77 8x; 9-slot weighted spin).\n\n### Setup\n1. Import this collection and `Lucky_77_Game_Local.postman_environment.json`.\n2. Set `admin_email` / `admin_password` (seed defaults: admin@example.com / AdminPassword123).\n3. Run **Admin Login** first \u2014 it stores `admin_session_token`.\n4. Start API + worker. Resume Lucky 77, then Snapshot \u2192 Place Bet.\n\n### Notes\n- Place Bet returns **HTTP 201**.\n- Snapshot includes top-level `slot_map` (9 codes).\n- After reveal, round result includes `winning_slot_index` (0\u20138).\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
